<p>Exploiting a gap in your target's defenses, you make a lethal strike with your offhand weapon for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">256%, 287%, 311%, 332%, 350%</acronym> damage that causes them to drop their weapon, disarming them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>Tempo will reduce the cooldown of this talent by 1 turn each time it is triggered defensively.</p><p>The chance to disarm increases with your Accuracy.</p>